2:T4c7,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is the strategist assigned to our account?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A senior Agentix specialist with 10+ years of digital marketing experience — not a junior account manager. We don't staff client accounts with people who are still learning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is this different from hiring a fractional CMO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A fractional CMO typically focuses on building and managing your internal team and GTM strategy. Our strategic consultation is more focused on digital marketing execution — SEO, paid media, content, email and analytics — with senior oversight of how those channels work together to drive revenue."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we combine strategic consultation with Agentix's other services?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — this is the most common model. Strategic consultation provides the roadmap and oversight; Agentix's execution services (SEO, Shopify development, email, CRO) implement against it. It's how businesses get integrated digital strategy and expert execution from one trusted partner."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Ongoing Digital Strategy Consultation\",\"description\":\"Senior digital strategy consultation for ecommerce and service businesses. Monthly strategy sessions, growth roadmapping, channel prioritization and expert oversight of your digital marketing execution. Our digital strategy consulting provides monthly sessions with a dedicated digital marketing consultant, growth strategy services roadmapping, ecommerce growth consulting and digital transformation strategy guidance.\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Agentix\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com\"},\